      "source": "Note that <code>RestClient</code> also supports and recommends use of\n<a href=\"RestClient.ResponseSpec.html#onStatus(java.util.function.Predicate,org.springframework.web.client.RestClient.ResponseSpec.ErrorHandler)\"><code>status handlers</code></a>.",
      "translation": "注意，<code>RestClient</code> 也支持并推荐使用 <a href=\"RestClient.ResponseSpec.html#onStatus(java.util.function.Predicate,org.springframework.web.client.RestClient.ResponseSpec.ErrorHandler)\"><code>状态处理器</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This method is only called when <a href=\"#hasError(org.springframework.http.client.ClientHttpResponse)\"><code>hasError(ClientHttpResponse)</code></a>\nhas returned <code>true</code>.",
