      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/IOException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\">IOException</a></code> - in case of I/O errors",
      "translation": "`<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/IOException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\">IOException</a></code>` - 在发生 I/O 错误时",
      "count": 2
